BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//real-estate-skills//contract-timeline//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
X-WR-CALNAME:Contract Timeline: 1532 Cypress Bend Dr\, Harrow Springs\, FL 
 32700
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:deposit-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260928
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260929
SUMMARY:Initial Escrow Deposit Due ★
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Deliver $11\,000 to Sample Title Co.\; get a receip
 t. If missed: Buyer in default\; seller may cancel. Rule: 3 days after Ef
 fective Date. Source: Para. 2(a). Ends at 11:59 PM.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Initial Escrow Deposit Due
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:loan_app-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:Loan Application
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Apply for the loan and provide the lender's written
  confirmation if requested. If missed: Buyer may lose financing protectio
 ns. Rule: 5 days after Effective Date. Source: Para. 8(b). Ends at 11:59 
 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:inspection-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
SUMMARY:Inspection Period Ends (Right to Cancel) ★
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Complete inspections (including 4-point and wind mi
 tigation)\; deliver written cancellation notice before the deadline if no
 t proceeding. If missed: Right to cancel for inspection ends\; deposit at
  risk. Rule: 10 days after Effective Date. Source: Para. 12(a). Ends at 1
 1:59 PM.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Inspection Period Ends (Right to Cancel)
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:insurance-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
SUMMARY:Insurance Contingency Ends ★
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Bind coverage or cancel per the rider. If missed: I
 nsurance protection ends. Rule: 10 days after Effective Date. Source: Hom
 eowners' / Flood Insurance rider. Ends at 11:59 PM.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Insurance Contingency Ends
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:title-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261016
SUMMARY:Title Evidence Delivered
DESCRIPTION:Who: Seller. Title commitment delivered to the buyer. If missed
 : Buyer may extend closing to review it. Rule: 15 days before Closing. So
 urce: Para. 9(c). Ends at 11:59 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:insurance_bound-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:Homeowners Insurance Bound (Lender Target)
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Bind the policy and send the declarations page to t
 he lender. If missed: The lender may not be ready to fund on time. Rule: 
 7 days before Closing. Source: Lender's usual target\, not a contract dat
 e. Ends at 11:59 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:loan_approval-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:Loan Approval Period Ends ★
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Deliver written loan approval\, or written notice t
 o cancel or proceed\, before the deadline. If missed: Buyer's right to ca
 ncel for financing ends\; deposit at risk. Rule: 30 days after Effective 
 Date. Source: Para. 8(b). Ends at 11:59 PM.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Loan Approval Period Ends
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:survey-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:Survey Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. If the buyer wants a survey\, have it done by this 
 date. If missed: Survey issues can't be raised in time. Rule: 5 days befo
 re Closing. Source: Para. 9(d). Ends at 11:59 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:clear_to_close-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:Clear to Close / Closing Disclosure ★
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Buyer receives and signs the Closing Disclosure at 
 least 3 business days before closing. If missed: Closing must move. Rule:
  3 days before Closing (TRID business days). Source: Lender (TRID 3-busin
 ess-day rule). Ends at 11:59 PM.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Clear to Close / Closing Disclosure
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:seller_terminate-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:Seller's Right to Terminate (No Loan Notice)
DESCRIPTION:Who: Seller. If the buyer sent no loan approval or loan notice 
 by the Loan Approval deadline\, the seller may terminate in writing withi
 n 3 days after it. If missed: Seller's right ends\; the buyer proceeds wi
 thout the financing contingency. Rule: 3 days after Loan Approval. Source
 : Para. 8(b)(v). Ends at 11:59 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:walkthrough-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:Final Walk-Through
DESCRIPTION:Who: Buyer. Walk the property the day before closing or on clos
 ing day\; confirm condition\, repairs and included items. If missed: Buye
 r loses the chance to verify condition. Rule: 1 day before Closing. Sourc
 e: Para. 12(b). Ends at 11:59 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:closing-165b093ec5@contract-timeline
DTSTAMP:20260924T110601
DTSTART:20261030T100000
DTEND:20261030T103000
SUMMARY:Closing ★
DESCRIPTION:Who: Both. Sign\, fund and record\; keys and possession deliver
 ed. If missed: Default unless extended in writing. Rule: Closing date in 
 contract. Source: Para. 4 · possession Para. 6.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Closing
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
